  <trk>
    <name>Runca Trail Upper: Startgels- Runca Höhe</name>
    <desc>From Super Mario Land to the jumps on Runcahöhe. The Upper Runca Trail starts right next to the lift station Startgels with a section full of flowy turns and berms. </desc>
